ull,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109049","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109049","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109049.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109049.patch","merged_at":"2025-10-01T18:20:12Z"},"body":"<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch in priority.\r\n\r\nRelevant fixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/contributing/development/code_style_guidelines.html\r\n-->\r\n\r\nRelated: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/93726 (in that I think this method should be added to `EditorInterface` too).\r\n\r\nThis method was not functional at all until 4.3 thanks to this PR: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/90136, but I don't believe it should belong in `EditorScript` because it worsens API discoverability and violates SRP since `EditorInterface` is meant to be the class that manipulates editor related data. It also leads to weird code where I have to create an instance of an `EditorScript` just to call this method in a script that doesn't inherit it. ","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_